<TextPage title="About" path="/about/" description={`About ${SITE_NAME}: daily horoscopes, Chinese zodiac and lucky days, written from real sky data.`}>
  <p>{SITE_NAME} is a calm, daily almanac for the modern reader. It brings together Western astrology, the Chinese zodiac and the traditional almanac in one place.</p>
  <h2>How readings are made</h2>
  <p>Every daily reading starts with the real sky. We calculate where the Moon and planets are each day using open astronomy software, then match that to a library of hand-written passages. Nothing is generated by AI, and nothing is made up for decoration.</p>
  <p>The Chinese almanac pages use the traditional calendar's own records of good and challenging days, translated into plain English.</p>
  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <p>Anyone who enjoys a moment of reflection with their morning coffee. We are based in Cambodia, which is why you'll find the Khmer and Vietnamese zodiacs here too.</p>
  <h2>A note on what this is</h2>
  <p>Astrology and almanacs are traditions to enjoy and think with. They are not medical, legal or financial advice, and they can't tell you what will happen.</p>
</TextPage>
